          "Here we will study the application of Euclid's division algorithm based on Euclid's division lemma. The word algorithm comes form the name of the 9\" century Persian mathematician Al-Khwarizmi. This algorithm is a series of well defined steps which gives a procedure for solving a type of problem.",
