          "Solution: (i) We have, circumference of circle = 132 cm.",
          "Example 2. Find the area of a circle whose radius is 7 cm.",
          "Solution: Given, radius of the circle =7 cm.. Area of the circle = zr\" = 22. 7X7 = 154 7 Hence, area of the circle = 154 cm?\" Example 3. A wheel of a bicycle makes 5000 rotations to complete a distance of 11 km. Find the diameter of the wheel.",
          "The circumference of a circle is 44 m. Find the area of the circle.",
          "The radius of a semi-circle shaped plot is 21 metre. Find the radius of the wheel.",
          "A wheel covers a distance of 88 metres in 100 rotation. Find the radius of the wheel.",
          "The area of a circular plates is 154 cm'. Find its circumference.",
          "The circumference of a circle is equal to the perimeter of a square. If area of the square is 484 m', then find area of the circle.",
          "The cost of constructing a boundry wall of a circular field is = 5280 at the rate of = 24 per metre. Find the cost of ploughing this field at rate of = 0.50 per metre ?.",
          "The radius of a circular grass land is 35 m. There is a foot-path of width 7 m. around in it. Find the area of the foot path."
