          ", there is a quadrant ABMC of a circle with radius 14 cm and with BC as diameter a semicircle is drawn. Find the area of shaded port.",
          "The sum of the circumferences of two circles with radii R, and R, is equal to the perimeter of the circle with radius R. Choose the correct option.",
